       "text": "A tornado outbreak struck Estenwick, Dray Corners and surrounding parts of Ostley County on May 19, 2026.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.2",
       "text": "Warnings were issued through the afternoon before the tornado damaged the Millrow district, Palfrey and the farm belt and destroyed Route 12 and the Dray Corners grain elevator.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "Deaths occurred in the Millrow district and people were rescued there, with no casualty figures released within the window.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.4",
       "text": "Estenwick Police deployed to the affected districts and the Ostley County coroner provided information as the response continued.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      }
     ]
    }
